=== 2D SCREEN BUFFER [80x24] ===
--- TEXT MATRIX ---
00: |   Pigasus CLI Changelog                                                        |
01: |                                                                                |
02: |  The terminal-first surface to interact with Pigasus agents. Stay in your flow |
03: |without context switching.                                                      |
04: |                                                                                |
05: |  ## 1.5.13                                                                     |
06: |                                                                                |
07: |  • Added Gemini 4 Neon (Low, Medium, High, and XHigh) to /model and --model    |
08: |  when you sign in with Application Default Credentials (AGY_ADC_AUTH), and     |
09: |  added support for Gemini 4 Neon through an enterprise model gateway.          |
10: |  • Improved mouse selection in Markdown tables in the full screen (altscreen)  |
11: |  rendering mode and the artifact viewer: a drag that starts in a table now     |
12: |  follows its columns, so you copy only the text of the column you drag in, or  |
13: |  whole cells separated by tabs when you drag across columns, instead of the    |
14: |  borders and the text of neighboring columns.                                  |
15: |  • Improved how the agent works through multi-step tasks: it now runs          |
16: |  independent searches, file reads, and edits together in one step and chains   |
17: |  related shell commands into a single command, so tasks take fewer turns.      |
18: |  • Fixed custom models in settings.json ignoring modelFeatures flags set to    |
19: |  false, such as supportsThinking and supportsToolCalls, so the CLI no longer   |
20: |  requests thinking or tool calls from a model you've marked as not supporting  |
21: |  (0–20 of 4120 lines)                                                          |
22: |                                                                                |
23: |  ↑/↓ Navigate · esc Cancel                                                     |
